Z||000010||ejayerik||12-12-2001||07:27 PM||||Kewl. That means that the tranny that got replaced in what was my 85 2M4 4-speed is an Isuzu 5 speed. I have to remove the vehicle speed sensor to check the fluids. Hey guys, which do you put in the trans..oil, or ATF??? The book says you can put either but mine has ATF. WHich is better?||||reg||1
